oss\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.10.46b862<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2025<br/>Summer Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250626134313&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Shadowstalker_849e89.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a dworc shadowstalker.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Can't kill, what you can't see!</li><li>Kill! Kill! Die! Die!</li><li>Stabby! Stabby! Stabby! Stab! Stab!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>You never see a Shadowstalker coming. If you do, it's already too late.\n</p><p>The dworcs, degenerate hybrids of dwarves and orcs, have long lived in the peripheries of both civilizations, mistrusted and mistreated by all. When the Norcferatu extended their cursed gift to one particularly ambitious dworc assassin, despite pacts and rules, the gift was shared amongst others and a new breed of predator was born. The Shadowstalkers.\nThese vampiric hybrids are small, fast, and merciless. What they lack in brute strength, they make up for in sheer cunning and cruelty. Their vampirism only deepened their natural affinity for stealth and murder, allowing them to move through shadows like ink in water. They whisper between the cracks of stone and flicker between torchlight flickers. They strike from behind, beneath, above - wherever the target is least prepared.\nArmed with poisoned daggers and a disturbing collection of paralytic toxins harvested from the Norcferatu menagerie, Shadowstalkers don't just kill, they disable, dismember, and disappear. Some say they collect body parts not as trophies, but as materials for arcane rituals whispered by the Nightweavers.\nThe Shadowstalker's greatest weapon, however, is fear. Once rumors spread of one infiltrating a camp or stronghold, morale plummets. Doors are barred. Lights are kept burning. But it never helps.\n</p><p>\nBecause when a Shadowstalker has your scent, darkness is no longer your refuge, it's your grave.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Dworc_Shadowstalker_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Shadowstalker_Artwork_1fbe09.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Dworc Shadowstalker Artwork.jpg (481 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Invisibility\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Invisible_Icon_ab037d.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Invisibility</span> (5~ seconds)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Dworc Shadowstalker</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250626134313&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Shadowstalker_849e89.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Life Drain</span> (0-625)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Dworc Shadowstalker</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250626134313&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Shadowstalker_849e89.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9500\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\